# English Coach — 30-day dev communication roadmap

Complements `english-context.mdc`. 30 days, one topic per day, 30–45 minutes each. Built for a React Native dev who wants to move from **B1 hesitant** → **B2 fluent** in real work English.

---

## 0. "Start english day N" — what the AI reads & does

When I say **"Start english day 1"** … **"Start english day 30"** (or variants — see below), AI has context and can execute without repeating the whole roadmap.

### Trigger phrases

| You say | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `Start english day 1` … `Start english day 30` | Start exactly **one** english-practice day |
| `Bắt đầu english ngày N` / `Luyện tiếng Anh ngày N` | Same — Vietnamese variant |
| `English day N` / `Do english day N` / `Today is english day N` | Same |

> Keyword **`english`** is required to disambiguate from the `coding/` track's `Start day N`.

### Context order the AI reads (priority)

1. **`english-context.mdc`** — profile, goal, strict mode, coaching rules.
2. **`english-playbooks.mdc`** (this file) — Section **1** (30-day table) for Day N + **Section 2** day template + **Section 4** linker progression.
3. **`day-NN.mdc`** — if it exists in this folder, open and follow.
4. **`english-linkers.mdc`** — pull on-demand whenever the day's linker-group is introduced or drilled (see Section 4).

### Expected AI behavior

- On **"Start english day N"**: if `day-NN.mdc` **is missing** → **create** it using the day template in Section 2, filled with the topic from Section 1. If it **exists** → open and run it.
- **Default language of day files:** **English** (immersion). Vietnamese only for short meta-notes when a concept is genuinely confusing (< 10% of the file).
- **Do not pre-generate** future day files. One day is created only when I ask for that day.
- After each day, append a row to `progress-tracker.md`: date, day, topic, confidence 1–10, 1-line note.
- Each day must feel like **a real work situation**, not a textbook drill.
- At the end of each day, give me **2 most useful fixes** — not every mistake. Senior coach, not a grammar bot.

### Day file naming & state

| Day | File | State |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | `day-01.mdc` | ✅ Generated (Daily standup) |
| 2–30 | `day-NN.mdc` | Generated **only when** I say "Start english day N" |

